Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:38:41 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(qwen4_exp cuda): load vocabulary-pruned Flash Next
 checkpoints

A checkpoint whose vocabulary rows were pruned and renumbered carries
ple-token-ids.json: each row's token id at training time and the vocabulary
size PLE's n-gram hashing was derived from. Config reads it, NGram hashes
canonical ids (histories and the PLE EOS hold them), and the built-in draft
list, written in upstream ids, is refused for such checkpoints.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011XiGQHTjzpMVa5sTqiQmg5
